    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d596">

                <pb facs="0705" n="631" sameAs="frus:frus1918Russiav01/pg631"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 861.00/2445</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Russia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Francis</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State
                    </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Extract]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Archangel</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1918-08-09">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 9, 1918</hi></date>. <lb/> [<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Received August 11, 1.40 p.m.</hi>]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>355. Arrived Archangel 10 a.m. Poole in
                    command here with forces advanced 100 miles south. Zubov representing new
                    government welcomed diplomats informally on wharf and I made noncommittal
                    reply.</p>
                <p>Diplomatic Corps approved and signed address prepared by myself to Russian
                    people. …<anchor n="1" xml:id="d596-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>Remaining on boats until domiciles secured. Archangel overcrowded. Probably
                    remain here some time depending on military movement and Soviet attitude.
                        Poole holding several Bolsheviks as
                    hostages for safety Allied representatives Moscow, Petrograd, Vologda, of whom
                    heard nothing; if Department advised concerning them please cable here.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Francis</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d596-f1" n="1" xml:id="d596-f1-content">
                <p>Address printed as enclosure to despatch of Aug. 15, <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >post</hi>, <ref target="#pg633">p. 633</ref>.</p>
